I have to agree with the other posters. Don't bore yourself waiting for
death drops. Try to push through the castle without MR. It can be done,
and it's not that hard if you are resourceful. Remember that liches and
nagas respect the E-word. Maybe you could polymorph into a xorn and go
straight for the wand. If  you have levitation, then it's easy. Engrave
Elbereth and levitate over it, then hack away. Another good tactic is
to go around the back, open the door to the main chamber, levitate back
over the first hole, and let all the soldiers fall through, to be dealt
with later. And if you happen to die, you're out of the boring midgame
as you say, and back into the interesting beginning game.


